@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### List only records already in PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rates
Accept: application/json

### Fetch USD/EUR if missing; repeat to read the stored quote
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/USD/EUR
Accept: application/json

### Create a manual rate, expected 201 or 409 if already stored
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseCurrency": "GBP",
  "quoteCurrency": "CHF",
  "bid": 1.12,
  "ask": 1.13
}

### Replace prices and set source to Manual, expected 200 after creation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/GBP/CHF
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bid": 1.14,
  "ask": 1.15
}

### Codes normalize to uppercase
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/gbp/chf

### Delete the stored record, expected 204 or 404 if absent
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/GBP/CHF

### Recreate a deleted pair through the selected provider
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/GBP/CHF

### Invalid spread, expected 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/GBP/CHF
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bid": 1.2,
  "ask": 1.1
}

### Unsupported precision, expected 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseCurrency": "AUD",
  "quoteCurrency": "NZD",
  "bid": 1.123456789,
  "ask": 1.13
}

### Same-currency pair, expected 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/USD/USD

### Unsupported currency, expected 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rates/BTC/EUR

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
